    "detailed_description": "When Maria, a globe-trotting antique restorer, arrives in the sun-soaked town of Bellariva, she has no idea just how broken it will turn out to be. She wants nothing more than to help the town\u2019s inhabitants save their most beloved possessions, but when it\u2019s their personal lives that are starting to fracture, she\u2019ll need to find a way to hold them together, one spare screw at a time.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/43029298c76a34dce3c32a50da61b005.poster.avif?t=1692002567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/43029298c76a34dce3c32a50da61b005.webm?t=1692002567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Figure out the inner workings of the objects brought to Maria and find a way to fix them.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/2a3cb6b44989db378184507bc452b1d2.poster.avif?t=1692002567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/2a3cb6b44989db378184507bc452b1d2.webm?t=1692002567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/2a3cb6b44989db378184507bc452b1d2.mp4?t=1692002567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/9ab0b7ca9f7e42c0b5db16439dfa66b3.avif?t=1692002567\" /></div><br><strong>Meet the townsfolk of Bellariva. Come to love their quirks and help them reconnect.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/60cd7ee2cb368fff1d88bb34570caa81.poster.avif?t=1692002567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/60cd7ee2cb368fff1d88bb34570caa81.webm?t=1692002567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/60cd7ee2cb368fff1d88bb34570caa81.mp4?t=1692002567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/8b8b3931c6e91df6dcac92911663afcf.avif?t=1692002567\" /></div><br><strong>Rediscover the defining objects of decades past to the tune of the original soundtrack, inspired by the sounds of the 80s.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/4a09b2b4caa1f344289da98f866c89be.poster.avif?t=1692002567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/4a09b2b4caa1f344289da98f866c89be.webm?t=1692002567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202900/extras/4a09b2b4caa1f344289da98f866c89be.mp4?t=1692002567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
